# Direct dependencies for .venvs/se, the only environment for ordinary work.
# Compile with scripts/setup/compile_locks.sh.
#
# NeMo 2.2.1 requires numba==0.61.0, and that Numba rejects NumPy 2.2 and later.
# numpy 2.1.3 is the newest NumPy that combination accepts. scipy 1.18.1,
# librosa 1.0.0, and nnAudio 0.3.3 install on that NumPy. Do not raise NumPy
# or Numba to the previous .venvs/se pins (2.5.4 / 0.68.1): TDTLossNumba will
# not import. Do not copy requirements/official.in into this file.
#
# mamba-ssm and causal-conv1d are built from requirements/official-assets.toml.
# openai-whisper==20240930 is installed after sync with --no-build-isolation.
